Your current code solves the Maximum Subarray problem using a **brute-force approach** with three nested loops.

### Efficiency Analysis of Current Code:
* **Time Complexity:** $O(N^3)$ – Computing the sum of every possible subarray takes three loops.
* **Space Complexity:** $O(1)$ – Uses no extra data structures.

